Thought: Explore per‑horizon complementarity (horizon‑specific strengths) to see if a weighted top‑k per‑horizon scheme on the stable pool4 improves over the best weighted inverse‑error.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"topk_per_horizon","k":3,"metric":"rmse"}

